<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANZ appoints investment banking chief.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANZ appoints investment banking chief.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd (ANZ) said on Monday it had appointed John Sunderland to head its global investment banking activities from the beginning of November.</p>
<p>Sunderland is currently employed by Barclays de Zoete Wedd (BZW) where he has lead a number of change management initiatives designed to focus BZW's approach to large corporate and financial institution clients, ANZ said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
</text>
